  prefix (verified collision-free) so there are zero duplicate-symbol clashes.

SCOPE (honesty covenant: no scope-narrowing, no stubs as final, ADR-011)
  web TwoFactorAuthPage.tsx wraps <TOTPEnrollmentSection/>. The thin page manifest
  record lists only the 2 page strings, but a title-only screen would be a stub.
  The FULL functional surface is reproduced natively (mirroring the sibling
  ActiveSessions P7 precedent): loading; forward-auth-required ("open mode")
  advisory; status panel (Active / Not-enrolled pill); activated body (last-used
  + remaining backup codes + Regenerate + Disable); not-enrolled body (Enroll +
  authenticator hint); enroll dialog (a REAL scannable CoreImage QR decoded from
  the data-URI + manual base32 secret + CopyButton + sanitized 6-digit verify +
  the four mapped TOTP_* verify errors); one-time backup-codes reveal (warning +
  2-col grid + ShareLink .txt export + copy + done); typed-confirmation "DISABLE"
  step-up; plus loading / open / error states for the status source.

