ADAPTIVE / HIG / a11y / units
  - macOS/iPad (regular): activated metrics + actions laid side-by-side; iPhone
    (compact, horizontalSizeClass) stacks them. Driven by the @Observable model
    (ADR-004) — no networking in the view body.
  - Materials via TSGlassPanel; tokens-only color/typography (P2 — Color.TS /
    Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius). Dialogs are HIG sheets; destructive Disable
    requires typing the "DISABLE" token (web requireTypedConfirmation).
  - VoiceOver labels/traits on header + status panel + rows + dialogs; Dynamic
    Type via teslaSyncTheme(); light/dark + increased-contrast through tokens;
    ≥44pt targets (TSButton). lastUsed timestamps formatted at the display
    boundary only (Date.formatted) — never stored non-SI.
  - Every visible string via LocalizedStringKey / String(localized:) from
    Localizable.xcstrings with web-aligned key names; zero hardcoded literals.

